    "text": "kmaland.com\nwebsite\nSergeant Bluff\nSergeant Bluff-Luton drops state quarterfinal matchup to Pella\nBy Taten Eighmy,\n1 days ago(Sioux City) -- Sergeant Bluff-Luton's season ends in a state quarterfinal matchup against No. 2 state-rated Pella on Monday. The Warriors (30-14) gave Pella (28-6) a close matchup through five innings, but the offensive firepower of the Dutch was too much in the end, with a final score of 12-5.",
